<!-- Rating calculation feature based on points and equipment.
 ************Note: After adjusting, synchronize with GetMain.
 This function is used to encourage members to buy and upgrade equipment to achieve a high Rating (Ranking) score.
 Calculation Formula:
	CharLucChien
		LCLevel * LevelNhanVat
		LCStr * Str
		LCAgi * Agi
		LCVit * Vit
		LCEne * Ene
		LCCmd * Cmd
		LCLvMaster * MasterLevel
		LCAddSkillMT * Points have been added to Skill Master.
		
		ItemLucChien
        IndexMin~IndexMax : IDItem
        LCGoc = Rating added when using the item
        LCLevel * Item Level (Level Up Bless, Soul)
        LCOptSkill = LC added when the item has a Skill
        LCOptLuck = LC added when the item has Luck
        LCOptLife * OptLife = LC added when the item has OptLife
        LCOptExl = LC added per Exl line of the item (e.g., Full Exl 6 lines = LCOptExl * 6)
        LCOptHarmony = LC added when OptHarmony is present
        LCOpt380 = LC added when Opt 380 is present
        LCOptAnc = LC added when it is a Divine Item
        LCOptSocket = LC added per line with socketed sockets
        *Note: You can add Index Items to increase the Rating points for some VIP items or VIP wings.
        Example: IndexMin="0" IndexMax="512" (All Type 0 Weapons)
        Add line: IndexMin="19" IndexMax="19" (After calculating the total Rating of the Options above, add the Rating config in this line)
        Stimulate the purchase of VIP items...
-->


